# Runtime state (users/sessions/connections/history JSON stores, uploads)
var/

# Vendored monorepo build artifacts. node_modules/.turbo stay untracked, but
# the compiled dist/ bundles ARE tracked: the V3 plugin-integrity hash covers
# shipped JS, so an on-host rebuild diverges from the signed bytes and the
# plugin gets refused in production posture (same rule as ui/dist — see the
# root .gitignore). Sourcemaps stay out (outside the hashed surface).
#
# The tracked @dbview/web bundle MUST be built in plugin mode, or the SPA
# requests its assets from the host root and the mounted UI stays blank:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/dbview VITE_BASE_PATH=/dbview/ VITE_AUTH_MODE=gateway \
#     pnpm --filter @dbview/web build
# (README "Operator setup" carries the full sequence; `pnpm -r build` alone
# produces the standalone root-base bundle, which is NOT what ships here.)
dbview/**/node_modules/
!dbview/apps/*/dist/
!dbview/apps/*/dist/**
!dbview/packages/*/dist/
!dbview/packages/*/dist/**
dbview/**/dist/**/*.map
dbview/**/.turbo/
dbview/**/*.tsbuildinfo
dbview/apps/api/data/
dbview/**/.env
dbview/**/logs/
